---
// HPO token page content. Recreates design/HPO.dc.html in the Warm Dark tokens defined in
// src/styles/global.css. Owned by src/pages/hpo/index.astro only.
---

<script src='/src/scripts/hpo-data.js'></script>
<script src='/src/scripts/hpo-sparkline.ts'></script>

<main class='mx-auto w-full max-w-[1280px] px-6 sm:px-12'>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class='grid items-center gap-12 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-12 lg:py-16'>
    <div class='flex flex-col items-start gap-[22px]'>
      <h1 class='font-fredoka text-[40px] leading-[1.1] font-semibold sm:text-[54px]'>
        <span class='text-accent'>$HPO</span>, the governance &amp; profit-sharing token of Hipo
      </h1>
      <p class='text-text-muted max-w-[480px] text-[19px] leading-[1.6]'>
        Be part of the future of GRAM staking. Hold HPO for revenue-sharing and decision-making in the Hipo protocol.
      </p>
      <div class='flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5'>
        <a
          href='https://app.ston.fi/swap?chartVisible=false&ft=TON&tt=HPO'
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'
          class='bg-accent text-on-accent hover:bg-accent-hover rounded-full px-9 py-[15px] text-[17px] font-semibold shadow-[0_6px_0_var(--color-accent-shadow)]'
        >
          Buy HPO
        </a>
        <a
          href='/docs/hipo-tokens/hipo-governance-token-hpo/tokenomics/'
          class='hover:text-accent px-3 py-[15px] text-base font-medium'
        >
          Tokenomics docs →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='border-border bg-surface flex flex-col gap-[18px] rounded-[24px] border p-7'>
      <div class='flex items-center gap-3'>
        <img src='/hpo.png' class='size-11' alt='HPO' />
        <div>
          <div class='font-fredoka text-lg font-semibold'>HPO / USD</div>
          <div class='text-text-muted text-[13px]'>Live market data</div>
        </div>
        <span class='text-positive ml-auto flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium'>
          <span class='bg-positive inline-block size-[7px] rounded-full'></span>
          Live
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Filled by hpo-sparkline.ts from 30 days of the hipo_hpo_current_price Prometheus series
      (the same allowlisted combined query the Stats page charts use). The height is reserved by
      the viewBox/class regardless of data; no line or fill is drawn until real points arrive, and
      none is drawn on failure either — never a fake shape. -->
      <svg id='hpoSparkline' viewBox='0 0 400 120' class='h-[120px] w-full' preserveAspectRatio='none'></svg>

      <div class='flex justify-between gap-3'>
        <div>
          <div id='hpoMarketCap' class='font-fredoka text-[22px] font-semibold'>—</div>
          <div class='text-text-muted text-[13px]'>Market cap</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div id='hpoVolume' class='font-fredoka text-[22px] font-semibold'>—</div>
          <div class='text-text-muted text-[13px]'>Volume, 24h</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div id='hpoHolders' class='font-fredoka text-[22px] font-semibold'>—</div>
          <div class='text-text-muted text-[13px]'>Holders</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- $HPO utility -->
  <section class='py-6'>
    <h2 class='font-fredoka mb-7 text-[40px] font-semibold'>$HPO utility</h2>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4'>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-[20px] border p-6'>
        <img src='/images/money.svg' class='size-11' alt='' />
        <div class='font-fredoka text-[19px] font-semibold'>Earn profit shares</div>
        <p class='text-text-muted text-[15px] leading-[1.55]'>
          Receive periodic distributions from Hipo Protocol's profits.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-[20px] border p-6'>
        <img src='/images/hat.svg' class='size-11' alt='' />
        <div class='font-fredoka text-[19px] font-semibold'>Boost Hipo Gang earnings</div>
        <p class='text-text-muted text-[15px] leading-[1.55]'>
          Hold $HPO to earn extra in-game coins and qualify for $HPO airdrops.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-[20px] border p-6'>
        <img src='/images/percentage.svg' class='size-11' alt='' />
        <div class='font-fredoka text-[19px] font-semibold'>Access exclusive offers</div>
        <p class='text-text-muted text-[15px] leading-[1.55]'>
          Unlock special discounts, rewards, and perks within the Hipo community.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface flex flex-col gap-2.5 rounded-[20px] border p-6'>
        <img src='/images/governance.svg' class='size-11' alt='' />
        <div class='font-fredoka text-[19px] font-semibold'>Participate in governance</div>
        <p class='text-text-muted text-[15px] leading-[1.55]'>
          Shape the future of Hipo by voting on upgrades, strategies, and key decisions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How to buy / Tokenomics -->
  <section class='py-12'>
    <div class='grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2'>
      <div>
        <h2 class='font-fredoka mb-5 text-[40px] font-semibold'>How to buy HPO</h2>
        <div class='flex flex-col'>
          <div class='border-border grid grid-cols-[56px_1fr] items-center gap-[18px] border-b py-[18px]'>
            <span
              class='bg-accent text-on-accent font-fredoka inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] text-[19px] font-semibold'
            >
              01
            </span>
            <span class='text-[16px] leading-[1.5]'>Get a wallet supporting TON.</span>
          </div>
          <div class='border-border grid grid-cols-[56px_1fr] items-center gap-[18px] border-b py-[18px]'>
            <span
              class='bg-accent text-on-accent font-fredoka inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] text-[19px] font-semibold'
            >
              02
            </span>
            <span class='text-[16px] leading-[1.5]'>Ensure you have enough GRAM for your desired $HPO purchase.</span>
          </div>
          <div class='border-border grid grid-cols-[56px_1fr] items-center gap-[18px] border-b py-[18px]'>
            <span
              class='bg-accent text-on-accent font-fredoka inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] text-[19px] font-semibold'
            >
              03
            </span>
            <span class='text-[16px] leading-[1.5]'>Head to the STON.fi DEX and connect your TON wallet.</span>
          </div>
          <div class='grid grid-cols-[56px_1fr] items-center gap-[18px] py-[18px]'>
            <span
              class='bg-accent text-on-accent font-fredoka inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-[14px] text-[19px] font-semibold'
            >
              04
            </span>
            <span class='text-[16px] leading-[1.5]'>
              Swap your GRAM for $HPO, and receive $HPO in your wallet instantly.
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class='font-fredoka mb-5 text-[40px] font-semibold'>Tokenomics</h2>
        <div class='border-border bg-surface rounded-[20px] border p-6'>
          <img src='/images/tokenomics.svg' class='w-full' alt='HPO tokenomics chart' />
          <p class='text-text-muted mt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.55]'>
            Each category in $HPO tokenomics is strategically designed to fuel Hipo's growth.
            <a href='/docs/hipo-tokens/hipo-governance-token-hpo/tokenomics/' class='text-accent'>Learn more</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Early investors -->
  <section class='py-12'>
    <h2 class='font-fredoka mb-2 text-[40px] font-semibold'>A unique opportunity for early investors</h2>
    <p class='text-text-muted mb-7 text-[18px]'>Proven, live on mainnet since October 30, 2023 — not just a plan.</p>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3'>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border p-6'>
        <div class='font-fredoka text-accent text-[19px] font-semibold'>Impressive metrics</div>
        <div class='flex flex-col gap-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.5]'>
          <span>
            <strong class='text-text font-bold'><span id='hpoTvlGram'>—</span> GRAM</strong>
            (<span id='hpoTvlUsd'>—</span>) TVL
          </span>
          <span>
            <strong id='hpoStakers' class='text-text font-bold'>—</strong> active stakers ·
            <a href='https://stats.hipo.finance/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' class='text-accent'>
              live stats
            </a>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border p-6'>
        <div class='font-fredoka text-accent text-[19px] font-semibold'>Thriving community</div>
        <div class='flex flex-col gap-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.5]'>
          <span><strong class='text-text font-bold'>3.1M</strong> Hipo Gang members</span>
          <span><strong class='text-text font-bold'>1.1M</strong> Telegram subscribers</span>
          <span>
            <strong class='text-text font-bold'>147K</strong> YouTube ·
            <strong class='text-text font-bold'>146K</strong> Twitter
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] border p-6'>
        <div class='font-fredoka text-accent text-[19px] font-semibold'>Room to grow</div>
        <div class='flex flex-col gap-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.5]'>
          <span>Only <strong class='font-bold'>12%</strong> of 500M stakable GRAM is in liquid staking.</span>
          <span>No private fundraising — early investors buy at a modest price.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Watch & learn -->
  <section class='py-12'>
    <h2 class='font-fredoka mb-7 text-[40px] font-semibold'>Watch &amp; learn</h2>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2'>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface rounded-[20px] border p-4'>
        <iframe
          class='aspect-video w-full rounded-[12px]'
          src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/QYU-TWJK1yg'
          title='YouTube video player'
          allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture'
          allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class='border-border bg-surface rounded-[20px] border p-4'>
        <iframe
          class='aspect-video w-full rounded-[12px]'
          src='https://youtube.com/embed/ZHAlS4wystU?feature=share'
          title='YouTube video player'
          allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture'
          allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class='py-12'>
    <h2 class='font-fredoka mb-7 text-[40px] font-semibold'>FAQ</h2>
    <div class='flex flex-col gap-4'>
      <details open class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>1. What is $HPO?</summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          $HPO is the governance token of Hipo Protocol, a liquid staking platform on TON. Holders of $HPO receive
          profit shares, exclusive offers, and a voice in protocol decisions.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>2. When is the TGE?</summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          The $HPO TGE took place on <strong class='text-text font-bold'>25th November 2024 at 12:00 PM UTC</strong>.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>3. What was an ILO?</summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          An Initial Liquidity Offering (ILO) is an innovative token launch model where tokens are offered directly on
          decentralized exchanges. It provides transparency, efficiency, and community empowerment from day one.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'
          >4. Why is the TGE held through an ILO?</summary
        >
        <div class='text-text-muted pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          <ol class='flex list-inside list-[lower-alpha] flex-col gap-2.5'>
            <li>
              Decentralized: $HPO is launched using a decentralized solution that adheres to blockchain principles.
            </li>
            <li>Transparent: All liquidity and transactions are tracked on-chain for full visibility.</li>
            <li>Open to All: Participation requires only a TON-supported wallet—no KYC or complicated processes.</li>
            <li>Low Fees: Early supporters can benefit from minimal costs, maximizing their returns.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>5. What is the price of $HPO?</summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          The initial price of $HPO on the DEX was $0.02. After listing, the price is determined by market demand and
          supply. Our goal is to list at a modest price, allowing early supporters to benefit from Hipo's long-term
          growth potential.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>6. What is Initial FDV?</summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted flex flex-col gap-2.5 pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          <p>
            Initial FDV (Fully Diluted Valuation) is a key metric for evaluating an IDO. It represents the theoretical
            value of a project if all tokens were in circulation based on the token price during the IDO.
          </p>
          <p>
            Calculation:
            <br />
            <span class='mx-8 italic'>Initial FDV=IDO Price &times; Total Token Supply</span>
          </p>
          <p>For Hipo:</p>
          <ul class='list-inside list-disc'>
            <li>Total Token Supply = 1,000,000,000 tokens</li>
            <li>ILO Price = $0.02</li>
            <li class='text-text font-bold'>Initial FDV = $20,000,000</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>
          7. How can FDV you make an investment decision?
        </summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          Compare the Initial FDV with the project's potential to assess if the FDV aligns with its current stage. Also,
          compare the FDV with similar projects in other blockchains to gauge its growth potential.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>
          8. Why does $HPO have great growth potential for early investors?
        </summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          <ol class='flex list-inside list-[lower-alpha] flex-col gap-2.5'>
            <li>
              Market Opportunity: Only 12% of 500M stakable GRAM is in liquid staking, leaving vast room for growth.
            </li>
            <li>
              Highest APY: Hipo has delivered top returns, and with TON's decentralization, it is positioned to capture
              a larger market share.
            </li>
            <li>
              No Private Fundraising: Early investors can acquire $HPO at a modest price, offering upside potential.
            </li>
            <li>
              Comparable Growth Potential: When compared to similar projects on Ethereum, $HPO shows significant
              untapped potential.
            </li>
            <li>Upcoming Milestones: Key product updates and market expansion will further benefit early investors.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>9. How can I become a $HPO holder?</summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted flex flex-col gap-2.5 pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          <p>There are two main ways to become a $HPO holder:</p>
          <ol class='flex list-inside list-[lower-alpha] flex-col gap-2.5'>
            <li><strong class='text-text font-bold'>Buy $HPO</strong>: You can purchase $HPO from listed markets.</li>
            <li>
              <strong class='text-text font-bold'>Airdrops</strong>: Become eligible for $HPO airdrops by participating
              in our ecosystem.
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>
          10. How can I become eligible for $HPO airdrops?
        </summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted flex flex-col gap-2.5 pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          <p>
            We announce Hipo airdrop plans regularly in our official channels. The two most effective ways to qualify
            are:
          </p>
          <ol class='flex list-inside list-[lower-alpha] flex-col gap-2.5'>
            <li>
              <strong class='text-text font-bold'>Stake Your GRAM</strong>: Stake your GRAM with Hipo to become
              eligible.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class='text-text font-bold'>Join Hipo Gang</strong>: Earn in-game coins, and boost your chances.
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>11. How to Buy $HPO?</summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          <ol class='flex list-inside list-[lower-alpha] flex-col gap-2.5'>
            <li>Get a TON-supported Wallet.</li>
            <li>Ensure You Have GRAM for your desired $HPO purchase.</li>
            <li>Head to the listed DEXs and connect your TON wallet.</li>
            <li>Swap GRAM for $HPO, and receive $HPO instantly in your wallet!</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class='border-border bg-surface scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border px-[22px] py-[18px]'>
        <summary class='text-text cursor-pointer text-[17px] font-medium'>
          12. How do you manage sell pressure after airdrops?
        </summary>
        <div class='text-text-muted flex flex-col gap-2.5 pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]'>
          <p>While the market determines whether holders sell or keep HPO, our approach focuses on:</p>
          <ol class='flex list-inside list-[lower-alpha] flex-col gap-2.5'>
            <li>
              Airdropping tokens to those who bring real value to the Hipo ecosystem, attracting long-term believers.
            </li>
            <li>
              Developing Hipo's products and market, creating long-term growth opportunities for HPO holders, and
              ensuring that any sell pressure becomes an opportunity for committed supporters to accumulate more HPO.
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing CTA -->
  <section class='py-12 pb-[72px]'>
    <div
      class='border-border flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 rounded-[28px] border p-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:p-12'
      style='background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(255,126,115,.12), rgba(255,126,115,0) 60%)'
    >
      <div class='flex max-w-[620px] flex-col gap-2.5'>
        <h2 class='font-fredoka text-[32px] font-semibold'>Build success with our community through $HPO</h2>
        <p class='text-text-muted text-[16px] leading-[1.6]'>
          We see incredible growth potential and are excited to capture that value alongside the whole Hipo community.
          Shape GRAM's future with $HPO.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href='https://app.ston.fi/swap?chartVisible=false&ft=TON&tt=HPO'
        target='_blank'
        rel='noopener noreferrer'
        class='bg-accent text-on-accent hover:bg-accent-hover shrink-0 rounded-full px-[30px] py-[14px] text-[16px] font-semibold'
      >
        Buy HPO
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
